{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49980","headline":"句 · 鲍溶","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"径草渐生长短绿，庭花欲绽浅深红。\n夜瑟弦惊绿流水，暖松花放碧香烟。\n窗间夜学凝残烛，轩下朝吟向暖风。\n幽客携琴好归去，七丝闲和百泉声。\n野寺访僧归带月，芳林携客醉眠花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}